BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-05T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-05T06:15:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nMILDMAY LINE: Tuesday 3\, Wednesday 4\, Thursday 5 and Friday 6 November\, until 0615 each morning\, no southbound service from Willesden Junction to Shepherds Bush. The 0552 first train from Willesden Junction to Clapham Junction starts from Shepherd's Bush at 0600 and the 0608 second train from Willesden Junction to Clapham Junction does not run. Use the next service at 0623 or local bus routes 220 or 228. The 0611 train from Stratford to Willesden Junction will start at Shepherds Bush at 0701 and the 0651 from Stratford to Richmond will start from Acton Central at 0743.
DTEND:20261105T061500Z
DTSTART:20261105T043000Z
SUMMARY:Mildmay line: Part Closure
